      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MANILA FRANKY (3) boasts a strong record this course with two wins and three minors from six tries. Placed last time (30.11) at this track in a Grade 4, finishing second and beaten one length. Looks well placed and should feature. RUPEE'S ROCKET (6) was well back throughout but attacked the line strongly to place, 7 lengths from the winner (35.22) at Q Parklands in Grade 5/6. The form out of his last race has been franked. Racing well and deserves a win. VISTA YANK (7) impressed when posting an outstanding 25.88 over 461m at Hobart. In form and looks a leading player again. FIRE WATER BURN (8) is always a threat when he draws this box.",
